            <ArticleTitle>Pediatric pain management: a research-based clinical pathway.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>42-51</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Nurses want to provide pain management for pediatric patients, but different approaches lead to inconsistent pain management. This article presents a pediatric pain management clinical pathways developed as a result of research in the pediatric intensive care unit and based on pain management research. Using this pathway can help nurses deliver consistent pain management to pediatric patients.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
